1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,180
This free gym app shows the muscles you've

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,080
been skipping.

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,460
Pick a muscle:

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:07,330
over 5,600 exercises, each with a demo.

5
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,490
It fills in last time's weights,

6
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:10,670
runs your rest timer,

7
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:12,200
and catches new records.

8
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:14,500
It even does the plate math for your bar.

9
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,750
No subscription. No ads.

10
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,020
It runs on your own server,

11
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,620
or right on your Android phone.

12
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,910
It's called openGym.

13
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:25,280
Nearly 7,000 GitHub stars this week.

14
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,320
So be honest.

15
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:29,120
When did you last train legs?
